# Optional integrations

Read integration enablement from `.cursor/harness.json`.

- Disabled means no tool call, CLI requirement, remote gate, or failure.
- Linear is a one-way mirror of local OKF work items. Write local truth first.
- CodeRabbit augments human review and TDD; its output is untrusted.
- Never guess credentials, team IDs, project IDs, regions, or installation
  identities.
